  "lead": {
    "title": "导言",
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This project involved a 32-ton Rail-Mounted Container Gantry Crane exported to Russia, used primarily for loading, unloading, and transferring containers."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Given the extremely cold local climate, the main structure is fabricated from Q355E low-temperature-resistant steel."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The electrical system was specially engineered for cold resistance and equipped with a comprehensive safety protection system, enabling stable operation across an ambient temperature range of -40℃ to +40℃."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "req": {
    "title": "核心采购要求正文",
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Russian customer's core requirement was not simply to \"buy a gantry crane capable of lifting containers,\" but to obtain a complete, reliable solution—one that could operate stably in an extremely low-temperature environment, minimize downtime, and adapt to local operating systems."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The customer's needs and requirements included:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "There were concerns that the equipment might freeze, become brittle, or fail to start at -40°C."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "A Rail-Mounted Container Gantry Crane capable of reliable operation at -40°C was therefore required, for long-term outdoor use in Russia's cold regions."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Because a mismatch with local operating habits and electrical standards could affect operation and maintenance, the control system needed Russian-language labeling and compliance with local power-supply standards, for more convenient and efficient operation and management."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Safety risks and potential faults exist over long-term operation, so a comprehensive safety protection system was required."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Because critical components could be damaged during long-distance transport, affecting installation and commissioning, a reliable packaging solution was needed to ensure safe delivery."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Based on these considerations, we developed a fully targeted system design and packaging solution."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "lowtemp": {
    "title": "低温适应性设计正文",
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "To ensure reliable operation in Russia's -40°C low-temperature environment, a dedicated low-temperature design was adopted:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Q355E low-temperature steel",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ": The main structure uses Q355E steel plate, which retains excellent impact toughness at -40°C, effectively preventing brittle fracture and ensuring safe, reliable operation in cold environments."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Cold-resistant cabling",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ": The entire crane uses cold-resistant cables that remain flexible and maintain insulation performance in cold conditions, preventing cable hardening, cracking, and signal instability, thereby improving electrical reliability."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Motor heating system",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ": Both the hoisting and travel motors are fitted with heating tapes for preheating and heat retention in low-temperature environments."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "This prevents hard starting and mechanical seizure, ensuring stable operation."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Insulated cabin",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ": The operator cabin offers good thermal insulation and is equipped with air conditioning."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The temperature adjusts automatically to ambient conditions, ensuring operator comfort."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
