            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The insulated operator's cab and cable reel were packed in wooden crates to enhance impact resistance and prevent damage during transport."
